STATION 1 sound library: not MIT

The multisounds are converted and are not our work and are not covered by the MIT license
of this repository.

  m1_data.inc         tables of the 100 multisounds (gen_m1.py --rom)
  m1_rom.bin          the sample data, content/m1_rom.bin of the update (~1.4 MB)
  m1_rom.inc          the same data as a C array (host tests, sample bench)
  drum/m1 drums.*     drum sampler kit: .aif (stock OP-1, disk mode), .raw + .sql (factory kit)
  drum/m1 perc.*      the same for the percussion kit

Made with features/m1/gen_m1.py and features/m1/m1_drumkit.py (MIT, our code). Regenerate from
your own copy of the sample set with those tools. features.py pack leaves build/ out, so the
feature's zip stays MIT-only.
